Dear all,

I recently got the Penn Treebank and was wondering whether there is already an R reader for the corpus. I was going to write one, but maybe I don't have to reinvent the wheel?

(BTW I just wrote a very simple one for CONLL dependency treebanks in case anyone is interested)

Best,

Matías Guzmán Naranjo

